From 428c42d199e75f14b0100559d94f98558f0fa1da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Arnowitz <alexander.arnowitz@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:54:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] MSSB port: native blocking pipelines, texture-size guard,
 frame dump

- pipeline_cache: native draws wait for their pipeline instead of being
  skipped (AURORA_ASYNC_PIPELINES=1 restores skipping).
- GXInitTexObj/CI: log and substitute 1x1 for 0 or >1024 texture sizes.
- aurora_set_frame_dump_id + MSSB_FRAME_DUMP: read back marked frames to
  PPM files for debugging visual glitches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GicfYcRfoFJtdTzMQVGDjR
---
